WEBVTT

00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:06.830
Mada dare mo mita koto nai

00:00:06.830 --> 00:00:09.700
Yume no naka de

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:17.660
Sagashita amai negai, kyou mo

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:26.040
Kizuite to, watashi no naka kara

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:30.910
Dare ka ga kimi e to sakebu yo

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:37.750
Mitsumeau, modokashii kyori ni

00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:41.000
Abaredashita samishisa

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.950
Kamishimeru hitori

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:48.870
Suki toiu omoi o

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:54.000
Iitai demo ienai

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:00.750
Itsumo soba ni kimi ga iru no ni

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:06.080
Mada dare mo mita koto nai

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:09.120
Yume no naka de

00:01:09.120 --> 00:01:12.950
Tomoshita tsuyoi omoi

00:01:12.950 --> 00:01:19.370
Mayowanai mayoitaku wa nai kara

00:01:19.370 --> 00:01:24.330
Shinjite ima, ippo fumidasou

00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:28.790
For the sake of myself

00:01:35.080 --> 00:01:37.120
You're going to take my life?

00:01:37.450 --> 00:01:39.830
Do you understand what's going on here?

00:01:39.830 --> 00:01:41.750
Try to take even one step.

00:01:41.750 --> 00:01:44.160
I'll cut your lover's head off!

00:01:44.450 --> 00:01:46.790
You should go ahead and do it, if you can.

00:01:49.620 --> 00:01:50.830
A wall?!

00:01:55.160 --> 00:01:57.000
Takuma-chan, now's your chance!

00:01:57.250 --> 00:01:58.120
Right!

00:01:58.120 --> 00:02:00.700
Don't underestimate me, you sow!

00:02:02.410 --> 00:02:04.790
You can't cut through anything you want
with your bare hands!

00:02:04.790 --> 00:02:08.370
If I use my hand as a sword,
it's basically the same, you know?

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:12.910
I've separated Takuma-chan from the enemy.

00:02:13.120 --> 00:02:18.450
When Takuma-chan finds his way
to Natsuki, we've won!

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:25.870
Did you think you had won or something?

00:02:25.870 --> 00:02:27.330
What a shame.

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:33.200
My ability is of the parasitic type,
and it's already been implanted.

00:02:39.580 --> 00:02:41.080
I thought I told you...

00:02:41.080 --> 00:02:44.580
My fangs have split his stomach open!

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:50.000
I...

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:54.580
I... can... not... die!

00:02:54.580 --> 00:02:57.660
I'm sick of this. I don't want... anyone else to die.

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:03.290
Academic
Achievement

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:12.290
Absurd...

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:15.250
That's "Misteltein"!

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:23.500
Why are you looking over there?

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:27.660
I'm the one you're fighting against, aren't I?

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:30.790
What the hell are you all thinking?!

00:03:30.790 --> 00:03:35.580
You bestow something like an "Yggdrasil Ea"
upon a meager human?!

00:03:35.830 --> 00:03:39.040
Meager human? What are you talking about?

00:03:39.540 --> 00:03:44.370
"Misteltein"... The mistletoe's branch
dwells in the body of the owner,

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:47.950
and that hidden treasure of Asgard
super fortifies the ability therein.

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:52.330
Hence, Takuma-chan's own ability
brought him back from death's grip.

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:56.830
Do you think Takuma-chan, who is recognized
by my father, is a meager human?

00:03:56.830 --> 00:04:00.410
Spit it out! Does that loser have that sort of ability?!

00:04:02.660 --> 00:04:05.370
Come together and get that sow!

00:04:11.370 --> 00:04:13.910
This bitch... I can't stop her!

00:04:13.910 --> 00:04:14.580
Hey!

00:04:15.870 --> 00:04:17.160
Okay.

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:22.750
I don't know what's going on.

00:04:22.750 --> 00:04:25.580
Though he's been revived, he's died once!

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:27.080
He should remember it all.

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:30.410
The pain he felt, and the fear that consumed him!

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:33.200
Is she seriously fighting for that loser?!

00:04:34.410 --> 00:04:36.910
Japanese & Math
3rd Grade Elementary Review
General Academic Review!

00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:36.910
Hey Mom, look at this!

00:04:36.910 --> 00:04:40.200
Oh, wow, you got them all correct!

00:04:41.660 --> 00:04:43.660
Hey Mom, will you praise me?

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:47.620
But you know, Takuma...

00:04:47.620 --> 00:04:50.830
It's okay to go outside and play sometimes.

00:04:50.830 --> 00:04:52.450
It's okay, I don't care to do that.

00:04:52.450 --> 00:04:54.330
I'll just scare them.

00:04:54.330 --> 00:04:58.120
Just watch, Mom. I'm gonna get the next set of
questions one hundred percent right, too!

00:04:58.120 --> 00:04:59.200
Takuma...

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:01.830
And also, I heard something on TV the other day.

00:05:02.120 --> 00:05:14.620
Right in the midsts!
Academic Society
Annual Salary 10,000,000
I can't believe this suffering
Dead End of Inferior Education
I should have studied more

00:05:02.410 --> 00:05:06.660
For those of you who want to realize your dreams,
choose university right now!

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:09.200
This world is generally an academic society!

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:12.160
Statistically, according to lifetime
annual salary measurements,

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:14.620
academics are the key to success!

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:19.580
If I study a lot, get into a good university,
and get a job in a good company,

00:05:19.580 --> 00:05:22.080
they said I can be a "respectable person."

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:27.040
If I become a "respectable person,"
do you think I can have friends too someday?

00:05:27.290 --> 00:05:30.910
You'll be fine. You're such a kind boy...

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:35.910
You'll certainly have friends one day.

00:05:35.910 --> 00:05:37.290
Really?

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:41.120
Come on, have I ever lied to you?

00:05:41.120 --> 00:05:45.370
You know, there are tons of things
I want to do when I make friends!

00:05:45.870 --> 00:05:50.910
Like study together, and play Tag! And also...

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:57.200
When I get the kind of friends
that aren't scared of being around me, I'll...

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:02.410
Out of my way!

00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:09.620
Now's my chance...

00:06:10.620 --> 00:06:13.410
He's somewhat taken on the look of a warrior.

00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:16.200
2,558 seconds.

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:19.540
That would normally result in severe punishment,
but I suppose this is acceptable.

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:24.410
Don't think that I'll let even a second pass,
from here forward you puppets.

00:06:24.660 --> 00:06:29.540
Eldest of the nine Valkyrie sisters,
Valkyria Ichika, Brunhilde,

00:06:29.540 --> 00:06:31.200
entering the battle!

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:33.250
Natsuki-san!

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:37.830
Takuma...

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:40.200
S-sorry it took so long.

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:42.870
That took way too long!

00:06:42.870 --> 00:06:44.200
I'b sho shorry!

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:46.700
What have you been doing this entire time?!

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:49.290
Er, uh, well...

00:06:55.040 --> 00:06:57.000
I'm glad you're safe.

00:06:57.660 --> 00:06:59.750
Th-thank you.

00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:00.870
Jeez.

00:07:00.870 --> 00:07:03.450
We can't afford to waste time.

00:07:03.450 --> 00:07:05.330
We're getting out of here!

00:07:07.410 --> 00:07:10.660
Oh dear, I suppose this is over now?

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:13.330
So what?!

00:07:13.330 --> 00:07:16.080
Don't get cocky, you sow.

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:20.660
You lot don't even come close to
being a match for Svadilfari.

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:23.830
What you're saying is very wrong.

00:07:23.830 --> 00:07:28.330
You mean to say if you're not going to win...
then just getting stronger is enough, right?

00:07:28.450 --> 00:07:30.950
Nurse's Office

00:07:28.750 --> 00:07:30.950
You two can do it...

00:07:31.370 --> 00:07:37.040
Val Love, "Embrace without a stitch of clothing on
and kiss deeply for five minutes"!

00:07:38.750 --> 00:07:40.580
Okay, let's do this!

00:07:40.580 --> 00:07:45.450
Val Love, "Embrace without a stitch of clothing on
and kiss deeply for five minutes"!

00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:50.700
Er, l-let's get started.

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:56.290
W-wait! Take a look at us, we're filthy. S-So...

00:07:57.410 --> 00:08:01.250
let's wipe each other down until we're clean!

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:03.950
Wh-why?

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:08.500
I already told you that if there's a single fiber
on our bodies then this won't count!

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:11.250
You can't check every nook and cranny
on your own, can you?!

00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:12.500
I-I-I'm sorry!

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:16.370
In any case, you're covered in dirt.

00:08:16.370 --> 00:08:18.000
I-I'm sorry.

00:08:18.450 --> 00:08:21.910
Okay, I'm done with your back.
Turn towards me now.

00:08:21.910 --> 00:08:24.330
Huh?! I-It seems I can't...

00:08:24.330 --> 00:08:27.700
Right now, the others are
restraining the enemy for us.

00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:31.580
We absolutely... positively
cannot fail this Val Love.

00:08:32.330 --> 00:08:34.660
So... please!

00:08:36.580 --> 00:08:39.000
I-I understand.

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:45.500
U-um...

00:08:45.870 --> 00:08:47.870
I-it's okay! I'll take care of it!

00:08:50.580 --> 00:08:52.450
I-I'm going to touch you.

00:08:53.750 --> 00:08:57.000
I can't believe I'm being tormented by
someone besides Takuma-kun!

00:08:57.000 --> 00:08:58.580
Big Sister Mutsumi!

00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:00.950
Kururi, stand back.

00:09:02.410 --> 00:09:04.580
Sacred Sword, maximum strengthening.

00:09:11.370 --> 00:09:13.700
Th-thanks, Yakumo-chan!

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:16.200
Thanks to that can't move anymore, though.

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:18.160
Where's Itsuyo? Where's Itsuyo?!

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:21.410
She's okay. She's with Big Sister Misa.

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:28.120
Pant Gasp
Pant Gasp

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:28.120
Um... So what's next?

00:09:28.620 --> 00:09:31.750
It's my turn next. Hurry up and do it.

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:33.830
O-okay! I'm sorry...

00:09:33.830 --> 00:09:35.540
J-just to let you know...

00:09:35.540 --> 00:09:37.750
If you try anything funny I'll be pissed!

00:09:37.750 --> 00:09:39.250
Right.

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:41.540
She's so cold.

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:43.290
I'm counting on you.

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:44.790
R-right!

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:50.870
Are you okay, Itsuyo?

00:09:50.870 --> 00:09:53.700
B-Big Sister Misa!

00:09:54.120 --> 00:09:56.910
That was scary! I was so scared!

00:09:56.910 --> 00:09:58.660
You're acting like a kid again.

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:00.620
Where did all those posh expressions go?

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:06.040
Huh? N-No, Big Sister! What's this?

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:08.290
Relax, Itsuyo.

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:11.660
Your big sister will save you.

00:10:15.500 --> 00:10:17.250
I'm done.

00:10:17.250 --> 00:10:20.620
We've finished preparations. Next is...

00:10:20.910 --> 00:10:22.500
Natsuki-san?

00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:24.250
It's nothing.

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:30.700
Let's start.

00:10:30.700 --> 00:10:32.080
O-okay!

00:10:32.080 --> 00:10:34.330
Commence Val Love!

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:41.790
I-I'm... going to use my tongue now.

00:10:41.790 --> 00:10:43.080
O-okay.

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:49.200
Wait for me, everyone...

00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:51.200
I'll come help you, for sure!

00:10:52.870 --> 00:10:54.750
Dammit, his breath is...!

00:10:57.870 --> 00:10:59.870
Guys, I'm borrowing your clothes!

00:11:11.080 --> 00:11:14.160
I-I can't breathe... What's going on?!

00:11:14.160 --> 00:11:16.790
Isn't deep kissing supposed to feel good?!

00:11:16.790 --> 00:11:19.700
It's totally different from what I read in that book!

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:24.500
Natsuki-san?!

00:11:24.750 --> 00:11:26.450
I-I'm fine...

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:29.620
Her body is still cold.

00:11:29.620 --> 00:11:32.250
She must be at her physical limit.

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:37.500
She was in the rain fighting and she didn't
stop moving the entire time I was gone.

00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:39.830
What do I do? At this rate everyone will...

00:11:40.120 --> 00:11:45.660
What should I do?
What do I need to do, as their lover?

00:11:54.620 --> 00:11:55.830
A book?

00:11:58.200 --> 00:11:59.910
What is this?

00:11:59.910 --> 00:12:02.540
My body's warm all of a sudden...

00:12:28.830 --> 00:12:32.580
I'm sorry I'm late. I'll defeat that akuma.

00:12:35.370 --> 00:12:37.290
I swear, by this blade!

00:12:37.540 --> 00:12:38.950
Seventh Valkyrie
"Siegrune"

00:12:37.540 --> 00:12:38.950
Blade Lv. 23

00:12:42.790 --> 00:12:43.950
Hurray!

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:45.040
Oh man...

00:13:02.580 --> 00:13:05.410
The akuma "Svadilfari" will devour everything!

00:13:05.410 --> 00:13:07.950
The Sacred Swords are no exception.

00:13:08.120 --> 00:13:11.410
What we need to defeat that akuma
are not cheap tricks,

00:13:11.410 --> 00:13:14.540
but the single swift blow of
one that will not be possessed.

00:13:14.700 --> 00:13:18.160
O Rune, please grant us power.

00:13:20.580 --> 00:13:23.580
I doubt you even care for Midgard at all.

00:13:23.580 --> 00:13:27.120
You could forgo that useless sense of justice,
but you care so damn much,

00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:29.870
you disgrace of a divine being!

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:32.120
Useless sense of justice?

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:37.370
What are you talking about?

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:39.580
I am, simply...

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:44.830
furious that my family has been hurt!

00:13:48.040 --> 00:13:50.290
Moreover, as for our leaning towards Midgard,

00:13:50.290 --> 00:13:53.370
it's untrue that this place is irrelevant
to the main deities.

00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:54.790
"Ragnarok"...

00:13:54.790 --> 00:14:00.290
You malevolent gods are gathering aether
for the great war that is to come, yes?

00:14:06.580 --> 00:14:07.700
Arrows?

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:10.700
That doggy sure is quick to run away.

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:15.200
Well, results-wise, thanks to you all
Takuma-chan has gotten stronger.

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:19.120
And now the rest of us can also
get much, much stronger.

00:14:21.370 --> 00:14:24.700
O Rune, please bring destruction onto our enemies.

00:14:28.160 --> 00:14:29.620
We're getting out of here!

00:14:29.620 --> 00:14:30.830
O-okay.

00:14:30.830 --> 00:14:31.870
Got it!

00:14:34.160 --> 00:14:36.370
The stronger Takuma-chan gets,

00:14:36.370 --> 00:14:38.910
and the more he becomes a man we yearn for,

00:14:38.910 --> 00:14:40.620
the stronger we can become.

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:45.500
After all, love is the source of a maiden's power.

00:14:58.200 --> 00:15:01.700
O Rune, please grant us this victory!

00:15:08.370 --> 00:15:09.580
Good grief.

00:15:09.580 --> 00:15:11.660
So this is what you were bragging about?

00:15:12.080 --> 00:15:14.200
Get out of here immediately.

00:15:14.200 --> 00:15:16.040
When you get back you will be punished.

00:15:16.250 --> 00:15:18.660
Piss off! I can still keep going...

00:15:18.660 --> 00:15:20.000
Shut up, you mangey mutt.

00:15:20.910 --> 00:15:22.950
You've failed your mission.

00:15:23.200 --> 00:15:25.870
Do you want to be disciplined after you're punished?

00:15:26.950 --> 00:15:29.370
But, a "book," huh?

00:15:29.370 --> 00:15:32.410
A restorative ability that trumps death.

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:36.080
If he gets any stronger than he is now
it may complicate things.

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:38.580
We must watch Einheijer.

00:15:49.200 --> 00:15:50.410
Oh my.

00:15:51.370 --> 00:15:53.580
What a beautiful sky.

00:15:57.790 --> 00:16:01.950
And now for the 99th Hokuou Academy
Joint School Festival Beauty Pageant...

00:16:01.950 --> 00:16:04.370
The glorious winner of the beauty pageant is....

00:16:04.910 --> 00:16:07.580
Mutsumi Saotome-san!

00:16:07.580 --> 00:16:10.200
Thank you, everyone!

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:26.370
Overwhelmingly Defeated
Withdrew

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:24.160
I'm exhausted!

00:16:24.160 --> 00:16:26.370
I'd love to dive into a hole right now.

00:16:26.620 --> 00:16:28.700
C-congratulations.

00:16:28.700 --> 00:16:31.950
Takuma-kun! Let's dance at the party, okay?

00:16:31.950 --> 00:16:36.120
Huh? I was supposed to be
dancing with Natsuki, though.

00:16:36.120 --> 00:16:38.870
Now that you mention it I never told you!

00:16:36.290 --> 00:16:38.870
C-C-C-Craaaaap

00:16:39.290 --> 00:16:40.620
With me?

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:43.250
Today was tough.

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:45.580
We were somehow able to drive the enemy back,

00:16:45.580 --> 00:16:49.750
but we barely got to do the campus festival date
that we've been waiting for.

00:16:49.750 --> 00:16:52.040
This means that we've gotta do
our best at the night festival!

00:16:52.040 --> 00:16:53.830
Itsuyo-chan! Natsuki-chan!

00:16:53.830 --> 00:16:59.410
Gloom

00:16:53.830 --> 00:16:56.200
Huh? Wh-What's wrong with you two?

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:59.410
I can't believe that Inukai-san was
a part of the malevolent gods...

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:01.950
Great work today,
President.
Oh, thanks

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:01.700
And he was such a nice boy, too...

00:17:01.700 --> 00:17:05.250
But thinking back on it, he may have been
pretty nosy with his questions...

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:08.450
By the way, President,
what's your ability?
It's the chain!

00:17:05.910 --> 00:17:08.450
Be a little more cautious, Itsuyo-chan!

00:17:08.450 --> 00:17:11.250
Why are you so down, Natsuki-chan?

00:17:11.450 --> 00:17:13.540
Uh, well...

00:17:15.950 --> 00:17:19.200
Can I really face Takuma after doing that sort of thing?!

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:22.250
"That sort of thing?!"
What did you do, Natsuki-chan?!

00:17:22.580 --> 00:17:27.370
Just as Mutsumi says, we have a unique chance
with the Val Love "Campus Festival Date"!

00:17:23.250 --> 00:17:30.080
Ta-daaa

00:17:27.370 --> 00:17:30.080
Each of us can be constantly with him the whole time!

00:17:30.200 --> 00:17:32.540
Okay, pay attention! Attention!

00:17:32.540 --> 00:17:37.330
The main event of the campus festival is
the dance party, so how does this plan sound?

00:17:37.330 --> 00:17:38.290
Ahem.

00:17:38.450 --> 00:17:42.580
The winner of the beauty pageant
can dance with Takuma at the party!

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:44.790
Wouldn't it be fair in that case?

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:47.750
Y-yeah... I'm okay with that!

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:49.370
I don't even want to do the pa-

00:17:49.370 --> 00:17:51.250
Shaddup, Natsuki!

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:54.290
You will become the strongest Valkyrie,
as acknowledged by Father!

00:17:54.290 --> 00:17:58.660
To do that... Natsuki! You must be the winner!

00:17:58.950 --> 00:18:01.540
The dance party, huh?

00:18:02.120 --> 00:18:03.870
No, er...

00:18:03.870 --> 00:18:06.790
It's not just that I don't want to go with Natsuki,

00:18:06.790 --> 00:18:10.410
but lately people have been getting scarier to me
day by day or something like that,

00:18:10.410 --> 00:18:15.910
and uh, it feels even more like I'm gonna get killed
if I'm with such a popular girl like Natsuki-san.

00:18:16.120 --> 00:18:19.830
So maybe it'd be better
if I paired up with someone else...

00:18:20.410 --> 00:18:26.040
Um, well... We all decided that whoever wins
the beauty pageant gets to dance with you.

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:27.290
B-but...

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:32.790
But I'm sure they didn't tell you, but,
you know, I think that you should...

00:18:34.870 --> 00:18:39.080
Are you okay with giving the right you won
fair and square up to Natsuki?

00:18:39.330 --> 00:18:42.790
Yeah... It kind of feels like it wasn't fair
and she let me win.

00:18:42.790 --> 00:18:45.830
You're honest in a weird way, Mutsumi.

00:18:45.950 --> 00:18:50.950
Besides, this is the first time I've been asked
something like this by Takuma, so I'm happy.

00:18:46.750 --> 00:18:50.950
Ehaha~

00:18:51.450 --> 00:18:53.290
You're quite simple, aren't you?

00:18:53.290 --> 00:18:56.200
Y-you're one to talk, Itsuyo-chan!

00:18:56.910 --> 00:19:01.330
What's the big idea turning me down once
and then wanting to dance with me?

00:19:01.330 --> 00:19:05.370
Err, there's something I'd like to
say to you about that.

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:06.540
Oh?

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:10.000
I can't face Takuma...

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:13.870
Why would he do something like that
and then continue going like normal?!

00:19:13.870 --> 00:19:16.200
This insensitive, perverted idiot!

00:19:17.750 --> 00:19:18.870
I knew it...

00:19:18.870 --> 00:19:21.750
Takuma really couldn't care less about me.

00:19:21.750 --> 00:19:25.040
Just a little while ago he was
so lovestruck by Mutsumi and Itsuyo...

00:19:25.040 --> 00:19:27.700
Could that be what he wanted
to talk to me about?!

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:29.790
Goodbye forever,
Natsuki-san
I want to date girls
who are stacked
with hot bodies

00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:30.080
Like that?!

00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:38.830
oh no oh no

00:19:30.450 --> 00:19:33.620
Is the dance today my last offering before he leaves?

00:19:33.620 --> 00:19:37.450
I feel like that might be possible,
but I also feel like it couldn't...

00:19:37.450 --> 00:19:38.830
Natsuki-san!

00:19:39.200 --> 00:19:42.750
N-no! I'm still a growing girl!

00:19:42.750 --> 00:19:45.910
If you look at Mutsumi and Itsuyo,
my future shows great promise!

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:46.830
So please...

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:49.500
Well, thank you for the other day!

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:52.870
Eh?! Thank you?

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:56.330
I was thinking that you asking me
to dance was an attempt

00:19:56.330 --> 00:20:01.540
to help me get over my illness
by being around people.

00:20:01.540 --> 00:20:06.160
And it's inexcusable that I made you mad
by refusing to accept after your efforts.

00:20:06.540 --> 00:20:08.870
Weak

00:20:07.370 --> 00:20:08.870
Um, Natsuki-san?!

00:20:10.250 --> 00:20:12.620
No, that was my fault.

00:20:12.620 --> 00:20:17.330
That was never one of the many reasons
that I wanted to dance with you.

00:20:17.330 --> 00:20:19.250
And you don't have to worry about that.

00:20:20.200 --> 00:20:23.250
Th-then why did you want to dance with me?

00:20:23.250 --> 00:20:24.500
W-well...

00:20:24.500 --> 00:20:28.200
The dance party will start in ten minutes.

00:20:28.540 --> 00:20:32.250
All who wish to attend please gather
in the school courtyard.

00:20:32.660 --> 00:20:38.660
Choke
Choke

00:20:32.660 --> 00:20:34.410
I guess it's time.

00:20:34.410 --> 00:20:37.450
It's terrifying to think about
just how crowded it will be, but...

00:20:37.450 --> 00:20:39.750
no matter what, I'll do my best.

00:20:41.750 --> 00:20:43.000
Natsuki-san?

00:20:53.580 --> 00:20:54.620
Huh?

00:20:55.200 --> 00:20:57.620
I asked you to dance so I can level up, of course!

00:20:57.620 --> 00:20:58.830
You dummy!

00:20:59.410 --> 00:21:10.700
shock
shock

00:21:00.450 --> 00:21:03.500
Uh, is there another akuma around? Where is it?

00:21:03.500 --> 00:21:06.290
We were able to safely defeat the enemy this time.

00:21:06.290 --> 00:21:08.910
However, they're going to keep coming to attack.

00:21:09.120 --> 00:21:10.700
So from here on out...

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:12.950
Will you help me...

00:21:12.950 --> 00:21:15.370
Help us, and stay by our side?

00:21:19.790 --> 00:21:20.790
Yes.

00:21:36.040 --> 00:21:39.450
Up-date! Date! Date! Please, please!
(Please, please up-date my love)

00:21:39.450 --> 00:21:42.700
Heart! Heart! Heart! Please, please!
(Please, please show your heart)

00:21:42.700 --> 00:21:49.250
Koi o shiranakucha you and I, hajimaranai no yo?

00:21:50.790 --> 00:22:01.750
Nine times out of love on cloud nine

00:22:01.750 --> 00:22:03.750
We wanna share your heart!

00:22:03.750 --> 00:22:07.000
(How do you tell me?)
Amai kotoba o input

00:22:07.000 --> 00:22:10.200
Shippai - Cancel - Zenzen hibikanai kedo
(Please don't be shy)

00:22:10.200 --> 00:22:13.410
(How to make dream)
Touch shite todokete yo

00:22:13.410 --> 00:22:17.830
Seikou- Complete - Saisentan ga ii darou?
(Hold me tight)

00:22:17.830 --> 00:22:22.540
Naze koi to itte kurenai no?

00:22:22.540 --> 00:22:25.580
Ai ni yukou

00:22:25.580 --> 00:22:32.750
Motto keiken shite level up otome gokoro

00:22:33.870 --> 00:22:37.450
Up-date! Date! Date! Please, please!
(Please, please up-date my love)

00:22:37.450 --> 00:22:40.790
Heart! Heart! Heart! Please, please!
(Please, please show your heart)

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:46.750
Oshiete ageru wa, koi wa otome no power!
(Love gave the power to Valkyrie)

00:22:46.750 --> 00:22:50.290
Jucchuuhakku kitto mou lovers!
(Please, please up-date my love)

00:22:50.290 --> 00:22:53.660
Tokimeku mune dance, dance!
(Please, please show your heart)

00:22:53.660 --> 00:22:56.870
Akuma de shy na mind kiss for you!

00:22:56.870 --> 00:23:00.080
Kaete shimau yo na kiss for me!

00:23:00.080 --> 00:23:03.450
Koi o hajimemasho!

00:23:06.370 --> 00:23:08.870
The akuma was super strong this time!

00:23:08.870 --> 00:23:12.290
Yeah. It would have been bad if Natsuki didn't level up.

00:23:12.290 --> 00:23:15.700
Me too! I should get stronger too, right?

00:23:15.700 --> 00:23:20.620
With my leveled-up cannon I could
take that akuma down like bla-blam!

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:26.370
Uh... well, you're still little, so you should
