00:23:26.370 --> 00:23:29.660
Then maybe I can help you with an invention!

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:41.000
Next time: The Reeling Maiden

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:32.040
Next time: "The Reeling Maiden."

00:23:32.040 --> 00:23:33.290
Big Sister Misa,

00:23:33.290 --> 00:23:35.620
is there anything you want me to make?

00:23:35.620 --> 00:23:37.450
Maybe a new rice cooker?

00:23:37.450 --> 00:23:40.160
Okay, I'll add a super rice boiling mode to it!
